## 1. Objective

The objective for Day 3 was to complete the first full inversion of the baseline six-source CMC DCM using the 20-participant grand-average MEG response for the Standard and Pitch Deviant conditions.

This baseline model used standard SPM CMC priors only. No receptor-informed priors were added at this stage. The purpose of this model is to provide the reference model evidence value against which later receptor-informed DCMs will be compared.

