The first inversion attempt failed during M/EEG-MRI coregistration because fiducials had been skipped. The successful retry used selected fiducials.

| SPM prompt | Choice used |
|---|---|
| Head model | Template |
| Cortical mesh | Normal |
| Nasion | Select `nas` |
| LPA | Select `lpa` |
| RPA | Select `rpa` |
| Headshape points | Yes |
| MEG head model | Single Shell |

This resolved the previous coregistration/fiducial error and allowed SPM to build the forward model and lead field.

